WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:08.060
This video shows how to record a fee payment on your phone. You pick a student's fee card and enter what they paid.

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:20.150
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Collect Payments. Scroll down past the filters to see one card for each student's fee.

00:00:21.024 --> 00:00:30.336
Tap the small box at the top of the student's card, here Ali Hassan. The card is highlighted, and a bar opens at the bottom of the screen.

00:00:34.009 --> 00:00:45.481
In the bar, tap Paid amount and enter the amount, here 1500. Then choose the account that receives the money, Main Cash. The payment method is Cash.

00:00:45.938 --> 00:01:04.754
Tap Update. The bar asks you to confirm the amount, the method and the account. Tap Yes. A message says the record was updated, and the card now shows Partial, because only part of the fee was paid. To take the whole balance instead, use Pay Full.

00:01:11.876 --> 00:01:16.172
The payment is recorded, and the status updates by itself.
